---
description: ShadowFlow trust boundaries for AI-assisted edits
alwaysApply: true
---

- Re-read docs/JD_TRACEABILITY.md when adding or removing a major feature.
- Never remove shadow variants or approval gates to get a green result.
- Do not edit evidence/test fixtures as a repair strategy unless the product contract itself changed.
- Keep LLM providers behind the WorkflowCompiler interface.
- The default route must run without external API keys.
- Generated automation comes from the typed verified WorkflowSpec, not raw free-form model code.
- Run pytest, Ruff, mypy and TypeScript typecheck before completion.
